    {
      "id": "qDbHMBV5DeSk5HYQN0NZy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 207.68030930466233,
      "y": 87.69728404202239,
      "width": 777.099365234375,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 692378016,
      "version": 973,
      "versionNonce": 1319338400,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787227233078,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Notification System\n\nHow does Zomato sends 50M notification?\n\nWhat is the problem with sending 50M notification sync?\nIt will cause the following problems\n\n1. backend will meltdown sending 50M notification which would cause \nself DoS\n2. FCM/APN rate limit will be exausted\n3. thundering herd problem ie even if 50M notification are sent if all\nthe users open the notification at the same time it will again crash the servers",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Notification System\n\nHow does Zomato sends 50M notification?\n\nWhat is the problem with sending 50M notification sync?\nIt will cause the following problems\n\n1. backend will meltdown sending 50M notification which would cause \nself DoS\n2. FCM/APN rate limit will be exausted\n3. thundering herd problem ie even if 50M notification are sent if all\nthe users open the notification at the same time it will again crash the servers",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
